{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Late last night when the [F]squire come home
[C]Enquiring [F]for his [G]lady
Some denied and [F]some replied
She's [C]gone with the [F]Black Jack [G]Davy
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
"Go saddle to me the [F]bonny brown steed
For the [C]grey was [F]never so [G]speedy
I'll ride all day and I'll [F]ride all night
Till I [C]catch that [F]Black Jack [G]Davy"
{end_of_verse}

